With these changes:

- handleClick/handleKeyDown no longer invert this.state.selected themselves.
- getDerivedStateFromProps will pick up the new props.selected and keep the component in sync.
- All multi-select + shift+click logic stays in the parent, and your tiles will faithfully reflect it.
